        "While the packet states that observers may learn the “uniqueness of predictive relationships,” it describes this in terms of comparing three associative-strength metrics and finding that the dual factor heuristic (DFH) predicts learning best; it does not define uniqueness as “specifically predicts another” using the exclusivity framing present in the definition.",
